{"title":"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A student attempted to compute the average <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/5/32581661cddf01ad30c1e36efe72f99eb0a0adca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> by computing the average of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, \nand then computing the average of the result and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. Whenever <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/5/865509d6730d6b57a0dc2bac61a9f42ee4537aed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; y &lt; z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />, the student's final result is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/f/79f69a7fb08635dd7ebbbdbdef0d70e4c9284e07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{correct}\\quad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{always less than A}\\quad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{always greater than A}\\quad\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{sometimes less than A and sometimes equal to A}\\quad\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{sometimes greater than A and sometimes equal to A}  \\quad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"481\" height=\"57\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The true average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/3/a43c22c62683950f7dc04355b7b27f5584fb9383.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=\\frac{x+y+z}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"117\" height=\"37\" />, and the student computed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/1/68148c2490e5d695a14de62c29a986f0e5ce552d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=\\frac{\\frac{x+y}{2}+z}{2}=\\frac{x+y+2z}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"212\" height=\"41\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/a/58a9d78a5eab485ab195ee9521c41165b4e21906.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B-A = \\frac{2z-x-y}{12} = \\frac{(z-x)+(z-y)}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"321\" height=\"39\" />, which is always positive as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/4/be4e3bd43598869760cda02cf201871c6fbc5db9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z&gt;x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/2/c320c71619dcd524877e17a292ef54037dc3c4e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z&gt;y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is always greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, i.e. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME\" title=\"1986 AHSME\">1986 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1986 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1986\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1986_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1986 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=